<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>KnightWorld - Гриферский сервер</title>
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #1a1a1a;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            text-align: center;
            background-image: radial-gradient(circle, #2a2a2a 0%, #111 100%);
        }
        .container {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            border: 2px solid #FDBE00;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(253, 190, 0, 0.2);
        }
        h1 {
            color: #FDBE00;
            font-size: 3em;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 5px #000;
        }
        p {
            font-size: 1.2em;
            color: #ccc;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .ip-box {
            background: #333;
            padding: 15px 30px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 1.5em;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: 0.3s;
            border: 1px solid #555;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .ip-box:hover {
            background: #FDBE00;
            color: #000;
            border-color: #FDBE00;
        }
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            background: #0088cc;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: 0.3s;
            margin-left: 10px;
            margin-right: 10px;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            background: #00aaff;
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>KnightWorld</h1>
        <p>Суровое гриферское выживание 1.21.11</p>
        
        <div class="ip-box" onclick="copyIP()">mc.knightworld.space</div>
        
        <br><br>
        
        <a href="https://t.me/KnightWorldTGK" class="btn">Наш Telegram</a>
    </div>

    <script>
        function copyIP() {
            navigator.clipboard.writeText("mc.knightworld.space");
            alert("IP скопирован! Вставь его в Minecraft.");
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
